  "note": "Annual election of three members of the Holywood Urban Council, ordinary day 15 October 1937; there was no contest (Northern Herald, 9 October 1937, p. 6). The three retiring Urban Councillors - S. C. B. Erskine (chairman), E. M'Cavana and R. Geddes - were the only nominations and were returned unopposed. Returned unopposed."
